{"reviews":[{"id":"B08KW15N2L-0","r":5.0,"t":"One of my favorite things!","x":"They may look a little silly, but are OH SO USEFUL!  Love them so much, I have bought pairs for all my girlfriends.  They are comfortable (nothing between toes) and machine washable.  Apply all your gooey lotions and creams during your pedicure, then put on your Pedi Sox to paint your toes.  Your feet stay protected and warm, while your polish dries.  Lots of colors and styles available, but the Leopard pair is just TOO CUTE!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-1","r":4.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"Every time I wear them in the winter for pedicures everyone asks about them! Love them! Keep feet warm while sitting in front of the door at salon, opening and closing. They do seem a bit better for people with smaller legs- there is very little give and will cut off circulation if pulled up too far- and I am the average sized girl!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-2","r":1.0,"t":"No Thanks...waste of money!","x":"I purchased these about a year ago and never used.  I finally dug them out of my sock drawer and used with my favorite foot cream.  Holy wow - they were waaaay too tight.  I do not have thick feet or ankles by any means.  They went into the trash immediately!!!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-3","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable not binding","x":"A gift for my friend who has Neuropathy she liked these because it doesn\u2019t have binding toes","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great for those with sensory issues to socks","x":"These are good quality and hold up well.  I don't use them for pedicures, just for regular use. I hate the feel of socks and go without them as often as I can. Sometimes the snow and cold requires something, and these suit the purpose of keeping feet warm without the discomfort of socks, around my toes at least.  If you or your child has sensory issues that make socks unbearable, this is a great alternative. I've tried other brands - some are loose and slouch around the ankle creating more disco","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-5","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty and Useful","x":"Lovely and fun in appearance.  They fit me better if I wear the &#34;Pedi-Sox&#34; logo down by the toes.  Also my manicurist told me that she always puts them on clients that way, as they fit most people better.  They are very comfortable and useful.  I like to wear sandals around the house in winter (the kind with a toe thong) and these keep my feet just warm enough that I can be completely comfortable all year round.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-6","r":5.0,"t":"Must have for pedicures at home.","x":"I use these all the time. So cute. I am more comfortable doing my own pedicures, and these socks keep my feet warm as the polish dries. Very handy. I used to live in a warm climate where pedicures were the norm. Now I live in a cold climate, but a pedicure is still a must.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-7","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"I purchased these after buying a really bad knock off version from eBay and I gotta say, these are SO worth paying a few dollars more! The shipping was exceptionally fast too.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-8","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love these toeless socks! Works perfectly with my Fit Flops. Would buy again!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-9","r":5.0,"t":"Funky and fun - serves a purpose too!","x":"My girlfriends and I just love pedi-sox!  Found our first ones years ago, and now we are so excited that we can get them on Amazon in great patterns and colors.  Keeps feet warm during pedicure and helps lock the lotions in for the rest of the foot.  It doesn't matter if you go to the salon, or do your own toes at home, these are cute, neat, tidy and clever - every woman needs a couple pair of pedi-sox!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2012"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-10","r":4.0,"t":"A bit small","x":"I have small feet (size 6.5-7) and I felt they were too tight to sleep in. I'm not overweight or obese either. They are cute and do their job, but i was hoping to wear moisture on my heels through the night while wearing these.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-11","r":5.0,"t":"Cute gift idea","x":"I gave these as gifts with a couple bottles of nail polish.  Everyone loved them and it was an inexpensive idea.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-12","r":5.0,"t":"THESE ARE GREAT!","x":"Love my Pedi-Sox - especially during the cold winter months!  I mailed two pairs to friends - we all love them!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-13","r":3.0,"t":"Not cotton","x":"They are ok but the are not cotton. this is just to  fill the space required to post the comment","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-14","r":4.0,"t":"Good pedicure socks","x":"These will be perfect for pedicures and open toe shoes in the house.  The  fit was fine , they weren't too tight or uncomfortable. (Used  For Size 7.5- 8 shoe size)  Seem to be just fine for what they were purchased for. I liked the patterns available.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-15","r":5.0,"t":"These sox are amazing!!","x":"These sox are amazing!!!  I wasn't sure about them but they are super cute & so comfortable!!  I actually left them on all night at home on our cold hard wood & tile floors after getting a pedicure in the afternoon.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-16","r":5.0,"t":"Protection for pedicures in the winter","x":"When it's cold and snowy outside, I can still wear my flip flops home after my pedicure with these socks on.  I just make sure I wear slacks in a color that is complimentary and doesn't clash with the animal print!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-17","r":4.0,"t":"Cute but quite warm","x":"Nice quality but lots of strings inside from the pattern weave. Easy to get hung up in them.  Also very polyester-y thick. May be nicer for winter.  I just put them away to try again when it\u2019s cooler weather.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-18","r":5.0,"t":"Pedi Socks you have to get them !","x":"Pedi socks are a great investment for any woman! When the  weather is cold  and you still want a pedicure!! Buy pedi socks!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2013"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-19","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!","x":"I wish I had gotten these sooner! It's a great idea, especially if you live in an area that has cold winter weather.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-20","r":5.0,"t":"Too cute per socks","x":"Arrived on time, as pictured and works for my peds in the winter","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2014"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-21","r":3.0,"t":"Very snug no easy to put on","x":"These Pedi socks are very snug. Do not go in with ease","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-22","r":1.0,"t":"SOX Run Quite Small","x":"Unfortunately the Sox run small and were quite tight.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-23","r":5.0,"t":"Made for women not men","x":"Let me just say....these are made for women. I was reading some of the reviews and they were from men complaining they were made small.  Loved these!  I was traveling from Maryland to Florida in the middle of March.  I didn't want to wear heavy winter shoes, but didn't want my feet to freeze either.  I wore these w/my flip flops.  Kept my feet warm.  Thankful I had them.  We came home to snow on the ground.  My Facebook friends loved them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B08KW15N2L-24","r":5.0,"t":"Snug and comfortable","x":"These are quite attractive looking pedi socks.  They fit nicely.  Wear well. Wash up nicely.  Cute patterns are available.  I also use these at nighttime to slather up my dry heels with cream - they work really well for keeping the lotion in contact with my heals and off of the sheets - and when I get up in the morning my heels are not anywhere as dry! !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Customers love these toeless socks for keeping feet warm during pedicures and while polish dries.","cites":[1,2,7,10,13]},{"text":"Many reviewers find them comfortable and useful, often buying them as gifts for friends.","cites":[1,4,10,12,13]},{"text":"A common complaint is that they run too tight, especially for those with larger legs or feet.","cites":[2,3,11]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the cute, fun patterns and colors.","cites":[6,10,11,15]},{"text":"Some note the material is not cotton.","cites":[14]}]},"qa":[]}